    "In Workiz, open Feature center → Developer API, then Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key. Allow Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read, Custom fields: Read. Allow Clients: Read & Write only for client notes. Set an expiry. The key stays in this phone's device-only Keychain." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "في Workiz، افتح Feature center ← Developer API، ثم Settings ← Developer ← v2 ← Create New API Key. اسمح بـ Jobs: Read & Write وUsers: Read وCustom fields: Read. واسمح بـ Clients: Read & Write لملاحظات العملاء فقط. حدّد تاريخ انتهاء. يبقى المفتاح في سلسلة المفاتيح (Keychain) الخاصة بهذا الهاتف فقط."
          }
        },
        "es-MX" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En Workiz, abre Feature center → Developer API y luego Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key. Permite Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read, Custom fields: Read. Permite Clients: Read & Write solo para notas del cliente. Establece una fecha de caducidad. La clave se queda en el llavero de este celular, exclusivo del dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "fr-CA" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dans Workiz, ouvrez Feature center → Developer API, puis Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key. Autorisez Jobs : Read & Write, Users : Read, Custom fields : Read. N’autorisez Clients : Read & Write que pour les notes de client. Définissez une date d’expiration. La clé reste dans le trousseau de ce téléphone, réservé à l’appareil."
          }
        },
        "hu" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A Workizban nyissa meg a Feature center → Developer API, majd a Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key menüpontot. Engedélyezze: Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read, Custom fields: Read. A Clients: Read & Write csak az ügyfélmegjegyzésekhez kell. Állítson be lejáratot. A kulcs ennek a telefonnak a csak az eszközön tárolt Kulcskarikájában (Keychain) marad."
          }
        },
        "it" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "In Workiz, apri Feature center → Developer API, poi Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key. Consenti Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read, Custom fields: Read. Consenti Clients: Read & Write solo per le note sui clienti. Imposta una scadenza. La chiave resta nel Portachiavi di questo telefono, riservato al dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Workizで「Feature center → Developer API」を開き、次に「Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key」を開きます。Jobs: Read & Write、Users: Read、Custom fields: Readを許可してください。顧客メモを使う場合に限り、Clients: Read & Writeを許可します。有効期限を設定してください。キーはこのiPhoneのデバイス専用キーチェーンに保存されます。"
          }
        },
        "ko" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Workiz에서 'Feature center → Developer API'를 연 다음 'Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key'를 엽니다. Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read, Custom fields: Read를 허용하세요. Clients: Read & Write는 고객 메모에만 허용하세요. 만료 기한을 설정하세요. 키는 이 휴대폰의 기기 전용 키체인에 저장됩니다."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Open in Workiz Feature center → Developer API en vervolgens Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key. Sta Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read en Custom fields: Read toe. Sta Clients: Read & Write alleen toe voor klantnotities. Stel een vervaldatum in. De sleutel blijft in de Keychain van deze telefoon, alleen op dit apparaat."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "No Workiz, abra Feature center → Developer API e depois Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key. Permita Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read, Custom fields: Read. Permita Clients: Read & Write somente para notas do cliente. Defina uma expiração. A chave fica nas Chaves deste telefone, exclusivas do dispositivo."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "В Workiz откройте Feature center → Developer API, затем Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key. Разрешите Jobs: Read & Write, Users: Read, Custom fields: Read. Разрешите Clients: Read & Write только для заметок о клиентах. Задайте срок действия. Ключ хранится в связке ключей этого телефона и только на нём."
          }
        },
        "ur" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Workiz میں، Feature center → Developer API کھولیں، پھر Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key۔ Jobs: Read & Write، Users: Read اور Custom fields: Read کی اجازت دیں۔ Clients: Read & Write کی اجازت صرف کلائنٹ نوٹس کے لیے دیں۔ میعاد ختم ہونے کی تاریخ مقرر کریں۔ کلید اس فون کی صرف ڈیوائس والی Keychain میں رہتی ہے۔"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Workiz 中，打开 Feature center → Developer API，然后依次进入 Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key。允许 Jobs：读写，Users：只读，Custom fields：只读。仅在需要客户备注时才允许 Clients：读写。设置有效期。密钥保存在这部手机仅限本机的钥匙串中。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 Workiz 中，開啟 Feature center → Developer API，然後依序進入 Settings → Developer → v2 → Create New API Key。允許 Jobs：讀寫，Users：唯讀，Custom fields：唯讀。僅在需要客戶備註時才允許 Clients：讀寫。設定有效期限。金鑰儲存在這支手機僅限本機的鑰匙圈中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
