        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "密鑰保存在這部手機的鑰匙圈中。它永遠不會發送到 %1$@ 的個人資料地址。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The list on this phone can't be read. Starting again clears it." : {
